    {
      "source": "This method should be overridden when the <a href=\"#spliterator()\"><code>spliterator()</code></a> method cannot return a spliterator that is\n<code>IMMUTABLE</code>, <code>CONCURRENT</code>, or <em>late-binding</em>. (See <a href=\"#spliterator()\"><code>spliterator()</code></a> for details.)",
      "translation": "当 `<a href=\"#spliterator()\"><code>spliterator()</code></a>` 方法无法返回一个满足<code>IMMUTABLE</code>、<code>CONCURRENT</code>或<em>延迟绑定</em>条件的迭代器时，应重写此方法。（有关详细信息，请参阅 `<a href=\"#spliterator()\"><code>spliterator()</code></a>`。）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation should be overridden by subclasses that can return a more efficient spliterator. To\npreserve expected laziness behavior for the <a href=\"#stream()\"><code>stream()</code></a> method, spliterators should either have the\ncharacteristic of <code>IMMUTABLE</code> or <code>CONCURRENT</code>, or be late-binding.",
      "translation": "默认实现应由子类重写，以便返回更高效的 Spliterator。为了保持 `<a href=\"#stream()\"><code>stream()</code></a>` 方法预期的惰性行为，Spliterator 应具有 `IMMUTABLE` 或 `CONCURRENT` 特性，或者是延迟绑定的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation does not report a size.",
      "translation": "默认实现不报告大小。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"CloseableIterator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>CloseableIterator</code></a> serves as a bridging data structure for the underlying data store specific results that\ncan be wrapped in a Java 8 <a href=\"#stream()\"><code>java.util.stream.Stream</code></a>. This allows implementations to clean up any\nresources they need to keep open to iterate over elements.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"CloseableIterator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>CloseableIterator</code></a> 作为一种桥接数据结构，用于封装底层数据存储返回的特定结果，使其能够被包装为 Java 8 <a href=\"#stream()\"><code>java.util.stream.Stream</code></a>。这使得实现类能够在遍历元素时清理任何需要保持打开状态的资源。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator</code></a> over the elements provided by this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "基于此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>提供的元素，创建一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a sequential <code>Stream</code> with this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a> as its source.",
      "translation": "返回一个顺序的 <code>Stream</code>，其源为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/AutoCloseable.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">close</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/AutoCloseable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">AutoCloseable</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/AutoCloseable.html#close()\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\">close</a></code>` 是接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/AutoCloseable.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\">AutoCloseable</a></code>` 中的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Closeable.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">close</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Closeable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">Closeable</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Closeable.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">close</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/Closeable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\">Closeable</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator</code></a> over the elements in this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator</code></a>，用于遍历此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>中的元素。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a sequential <code>Stream</code> over the elements in this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个按顺序遍历此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Iterator</code></a>中元素的<code>Stream</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Thomas Darimont, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "托马斯·达里蒙特，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator</code></a> over the elements provided by this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>. Implementations should document\ncharacteristic values reported by the spliterator. Such characteristic values are not required to be reported if\nthe spliterator reports <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html#SIZED\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator.SIZED</code></a> and this collection contains no elements.",
      "translation": "在此 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a> 提供的元素上创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator</code></a>。实现应记录该分割器报告的特定值。如果该分割器报告了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Spliterator.html#SIZED\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Spliterator.SIZED</code></a> 且此集合不包含任何元素，则无需报告这些特定值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a sequential <code>Stream</code> with this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a> as its source. The resulting stream calls\n<a href=\"#close()\"><code>close()</code></a> when <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/BaseStream.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>closed</code></a>. The resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> must be closed after use, it can\nbe declared as a resource in a <code>try</code>-with-resources statement.",
      "translation": "返回一个以该<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>为源的顺序<code>Stream</code>。当流处于<a href=\"#close()\"><code>closed</code></a>状态时，生成的流会调用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/BaseStream.html#close()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>close()</code></a>。生成的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a>在使用后必须关闭，它可以作为资源声明在<code>try</code>-with-resources 语句中。",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
}